WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:36.370
After defeating Zorc, I return to the real world for one final test: a ritual battle.

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:43.580
My partner stepped up to be my final opponent and determine my fate.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.760
Thank you, partner.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:48.740
You're the only opponent for me.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:53.340
Let’s battle with all our strength!

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:59.340
The Last Duel of Destiny

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.090
This is the place.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.130
Anzu?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:36.810
Do we have to rush this?

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.150
Let's stay together a little longer.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:42.160
At least for today.

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.570
Anzu, don't say that.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.570
But I know how you feel.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:48.800
Anzu...

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:56.640
Anzu, the battle ritual to send the Pharaoh to the afterlife...

00:02:56.640 --> 00:03:02.460
...must be held when both duelists are at their peak.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:10.170
Since Zorc has been defeated and the Pharaoh has regained his memories, now is the time.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:16.280
If they don’t duel now, the Pharaoh’s spirit must stay in this world for eternity.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.910
Do you want that?

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.480
It's tough for me too.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:30.200
But my other self has decided that we must go through with this battle.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.500
Yeah...

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.860
I’m sorry.  You’re right.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.900
Anzu understands the situation.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:44.040
But she couldn't help but to speak up, because this is her last chance.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.240
I know how she feels.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:52.720
Yeah.  Anzu said what we're all feeling.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:04:00.650
Since I made time to come here, I won't let this duel be canceled or postponed.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.600
No one invited you!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:08.970
Let’s go!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.810
That’s the Tablet of the Afterlife?

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.250
Yugi.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:50.450
Place the seven ancient treasures in the Tablet of Memories and say the Pharaoh’s name.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:56.380
This will open the Door to the Afterlife and welcome the Pharaoh’s soul.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:05:05.830
But the Eye of Udjat sees the truth of the one who'll take the Pharaoh’s sword and subdue his soul.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:13.870
If you accept the battle ritual, place the seven Millennium Items in the tablet.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:52.730
It all started when Yugi assembled the Millennium Puzzle.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.410
Back then, I...

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:00.350
I want a friend!

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:07.120
The Millennium Puzzle granted my wish.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.260
Thank you, Millennium Puzzle.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.480
The eye on the door is glowing!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:42.210
The Eye of Udjat sees the true souls of the battle ritual's participants.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.390
Look!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.720
Yugi’s shadows...

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.980
There are two Yugis!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.970
So that’s the other one.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:05.900
Yugi?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.780
Atem...

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.800
Their battle is about to begin.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:24.390
I don’t know who I should root for.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:30.430
If Atem wins, he can stay with us.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:35.990
I’m rooting for Yugi so that Atem can go to the afterlife!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.740
That's right.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:42.820
It pains me, but Atem’s soul needs to go free.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.780
So I’ll also root for Yugi!

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:46.290
Sister...

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.720
This test will determine their destiny.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.520
Only they can determine the result.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:08:00.460
Yugi, thank you for accepting this battle.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:02.830
But I’m a duelist.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:08.040
My pride says that I must defeat my opponents with all my strength.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:17.140
If I don’t become stronger, my other self can never leave my soul.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.900
That’s why...

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.400
...I will defeat you!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:35.570
The ultimate battle to determine the Duel King is about to begin.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:36.920
Yugi...

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:39.760
Atem...

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:41.900
Let's go, partner!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.350
Here I come, my other self!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.780
Duel!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.940
I'll go first.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:54.480
I draw!

00:08:54.990 --> 00:09:01.230
I discard one card to Special Summon The Tricky in attack position!

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:06.870
Then I set one card and end my turn!

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:11.800
He Special Summoned a monster with 2000 attack points!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:15.250
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.040
I activate my spell card!

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:20.010
Swords of Revealing Light!

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.190
Atem can’t attack for three turns!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.550
I summon Green Gadget in attack position!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:34.960
Green Gadget’s effect lets me draw Red Gadget from my deck!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:39.140
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:45.000
After summoning a high-Level monster, I thought Atem would have the advantage.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.070
But Yugi took control of this duel!

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:53.370
If he's taking this duel seriously, he'll play his God Cards.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:56.150
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:10:01.550
Partner, Swords of Revealing Light won't stop every attack.

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:05.210
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.800
Rebellion?

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:11.510
I select a monster, and it attacks its owner!

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:15.000
The monster I select is Green Gadget!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.100
It attacks you directly!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.800
I expected this.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:24.310
I flip over my set card!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:28.020
The trap card, Stronghold the Moving Fortress!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:40.630
It transforms into a monster card and is Special Summoned in defense position!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:49.520
But you still take damage from the battle.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:55.040
I see!  Green Gadget belongs to Yugi!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:59.100
But he was able to minimize the damage from a direct attack.

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.620
I end my turn.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:07.320
I was able to damage his life points, but I've never seen that card in my partner's deck before.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:11.760
He has built his own deck.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:18.700
My other self, I have everything I need in my hand for my special combo.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.040
I'm looking forward to it.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:24.450
Show me all your strength.

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:30.810
But when you do, the power of the Gods in my deck will activate.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.500
My turn!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.510
I draw!

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:51.970
I activate my spell card!

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:53.470
Ties of the Brethren!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:56.960
I pay 1000 life points...

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:03.110
...to Special Summon up to two Level 4 monsters with the same Type as a monster on the field.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:09.490
I Special Summon Red Gadget and Yellow Gadget in defense position!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:16.200
You can't defeat me by solely building up your defenses.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.680
You’re wrong.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.520
What?

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:22.300
Gadgets!  Become Stronghold's gears!

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:30.040
Begin to move, Stronghold!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:40.100
When the three Gadgets are faceup...

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:45.150
...Stronghold the Moving Fortress becomes a monster with 3000 attack points!

00:12:45.150 --> 00:12:48.370
That's what Yugi was aiming for!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.120
Stronghold the Moving Fortress attacks!

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.490
Steel Gear Crush!

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:05.250
I activate the spell card, Bounce Spell!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:10.170
Swords of Revealing Light will now seal your monsters for three turns!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.780
You were close, but you still have much to learn.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:16.500
The other Yugi is impressive.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.720
He’s thinking several steps ahead.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:20.120
He’s tough.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:20.790
Yeah.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.840
I’m not shaking because I’m scared.

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:29.880
It’s because I’m happy that you’re taking me seriously.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:34.780
I switch Green Gadget to defense position and end my turn.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:38.490
I see in your eyes that you haven’t given up.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:40.810
But I’m only getting started!

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.710
My turn!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.510
I draw!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:50.800
By sending The Tricky to the graveyard, I can activate my spell card, Tricky Spell 4!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:58.420
I Special Summon a Tricky Token in defense position for every monster on your field.

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:01.650
Yugi has four monsters on his field.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:06.820
For the first time in this duel, the other Yugi will have many monsters.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:10.830
Here I go, partner!

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:14.740
I’ll show you my true power!

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.040
Can it be?

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:16.920
It’s coming!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:20.350
I tribute three Tricky Tokens!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:23.370
I summon Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:32.190
Obelisk!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.040
He summoned a God!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.490
Atem’s deck is incredible!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:44.980
He’s showing no mercy!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:48.580
It's the perfect deck to thoroughly defeat Yugi!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.590
Obelisk attacks!

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:53.950
Pulverize Stronghold the Moving Fortress!

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.020
God Hand Crusher!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.500
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.720
Yugi!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:11.420
Yugi!  Hang in there!

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.730
Don’t give up!

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:14.880
Yugi...

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:21.580
But not only did he summon a God, Yugi’s monsters can’t attack due to Swords of Revealing Light.

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:26.330
Partner, is this the best you can do?

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:33.150
Despite the situation, he’s still confident?

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:37.130
No.  Yugi knows he has few options left.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.100
Then why's he smiling?

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:43.210
Maybe Yugi doesn’t want to part with Atem.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:44.890
Don’t be foolish!

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:49.070
He’s not a duelist who laughs when he knows he's going to lose!

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:50.930
Jonouchi...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.010
He’s enjoying this.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:57.880
He's happy that he's dueling the other Yugi.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:04.340
He’s facing the other Yugi for the first time, battling with all their hearts.

00:16:04.340 --> 00:16:10.970
Yugi was always chasing him from behind, but now he's battling him face-to-face.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.990
From behind...

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.930
Yugi, show him how strong you are!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.860
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:21.310
I set three cards!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:26.480
Then I summon Silent Swordsman LV0!

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:30.980
Nice!  Silent Swordsman is the monster that defeated Bakura!

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.120
Huh?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:35.050
I place it in attack position and end my turn!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.960
Attack position?

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:41.420
If it’s attacked on the next turn, the duel's over!

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:44.780
He must have a plan to defeat the God.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:50.160
The God Cards are hard to use, so you usually only put one in your deck.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.860
If he destroys Obelisk, he'll have no other Gods.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.040
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:57.810
I set one card!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.980
I activate Card of Sanctity from my hand!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:06.750
We both draw until we have six cards in our hands!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.360
Partner...

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.430
My other self...

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:17.550
We must both use all our strength in this duel.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.760
Or we won't have a true result.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:24.670
I will use all my strength!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:26.290
Can you keep up, partner?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:28.970
I’ll also use all my strength to surpass you!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.800
Obelisk the Tormentor attacks Silent Swordsman!

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:36.610
Here I go, partner!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.290
God Hand Crusher!

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.720
Yugi!

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.680
I flip over my set card!

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:45.000
Ground Erosion!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.660
Then I activate my Quick-Play Spell, Turn Jump!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:54.050
We both can't play for three turns!

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:05.330
Silent Swordsman levels up from 0 to 3!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.270
That’s not enough, partner!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.580
It’s less than Obelisk’s 4000 attack points!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:18.190
But I activate Ground Erosion's effect by tributing it!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:20.770
Traps don’t work against a God!

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:22.430
I’m not using it on your God!

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.560
I’m using it on its field!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.280
What?

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:30.870
After revealing Ground Erosion, for every turn that passes before activation...

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:35.160
...the monster standing on the erosion loses 500 attack points!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.960
Due to Turn Jump, three turns have passed.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:42.270
So Obelisk loses 1500 attack points!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:45.720
Silent Swordsman and the God have equal strength.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:49.720
So they'll both be destroyed in battle.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:54.340
Partner, I also activated a trap on my field.

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:57.640
The Continuous Trap, Summoning Clock!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:02.330
It activates when you activate a spell or trap card on your field.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:07.500
By tributing this card and one monster, for every turn that passed...

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:11.440
...I can Special Summon a monster from my hand without tributing!

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:14.110
You can summon three monsters?

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:21.160
Due to King Knight’s effect, I Special Summon Jack's Knight!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:27.530
Then I Special Summon Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:28.940
Unbelievable!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.360
A second God?

00:19:49.150 --> 00:19:54.820
Slifer's attack points are determined by the number of cards in my hand.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.580
I have three cards in my hand.

00:19:58.530 --> 00:20:02.400
I flip over my trap card, Ambush Shield!

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.970
I activate it by tributing a monster!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:11.330
I add the tributed monster's defense points to another monster's attack points for this turn!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:13.560
4000 attack points!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.780
Yugi’s monster is stronger than Slifer!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:19.210
Not bad, Yugi.  In that case...

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:24.850
King's Knight and Queen's Knight attack Green Gadget and Yellow Gadget!

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:33.860
My Battle Phase is now over.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:37.860
But I can still summon a monster this turn!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:44.140
I tribute Queen's Knight, Jack's Knight and King's Knight!

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:46.700
Can it be?

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:47.600
No way!

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:56.050
That's hieratic text!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.230
My other self...

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:10.580
I summon the third God, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:16.840
Come forth, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:22.210
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:38.670
The three Gods!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.300
He summoned all three Gods?

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:46.060
Partner, this is my full power!

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:13.900
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.060 --> 00:22:29.620
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:35.460
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.780 --> 00:22:44.030
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:49.670
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:58.140
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:03.950
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.740 --> 00:23:12.090
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:15.350
In a duel

00:23:27.530 --> 00:23:31.150
Atem and Yugi's duel has finally started.

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:40.000
They were fighting at equal strength, until Atem took control by summoning the three Gods.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:43.180
Is there anything Yugi can do?

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:48.610
Maybe Atem never planned on returning to the afterlife?

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:51.680
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Defeat the Three Gods!

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:53.150
Duel, standby!
